      "description": "Keeps a CTF or training-lab engagement's tool output and notes in one directory as records, each field naming the file and the exact line it came from. Parsers read nmap, NetExec, secretsdump, BloodHound and certipy; anything else the agent extracts, and a value whose quote is not in the source file is dropped."
